      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 17 - Scrapling Research Fetch (draft)\n\n**Direct:** `http://ai-trading-scrapling:8080/fetch`\n**Backend alias:** `http://ai-trading-backend:8000/api/research/fetch`\n**Auth:** Scrapling QT (httpBearerAuth)\n\nBody: `{ \"url\", \"mode\": \"http|stealth\", \"extraction_type\": \"markdown|html|text\", \"css_selector?\" }`\nResearch only \u2014 no prices, no orders.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "norm-e32ea096",
      "name": "Normalize Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw=$input.first().json||{};\nconst body=(raw.body && typeof raw.body==='object')?raw.body:raw;\nconst url=String(body.url||body.link||'').trim();\nconst mode=['http','stealth'].includes(String(body.mode||'').toLowerCase())?String(body.mode).toLowerCase():'http';\nconst extraction_type=['markdown','html','text'].includes(String(body.extraction_type||body.format||'').toLowerCase())?String(body.extraction_type||body.format).toLowerCase():'markdown';\nconst css_selector=body.css_selector?String(body.css_selector):null;\nif(!url.startsWith('http')) return [{json:{ok:false,error:'url required (public http/https)', url}}];\nconst payload={url, mode, extraction_type};\nif(css_selector) payload.css_selector=css_selector;\nreturn [{json:{ok:true, payload}}];"
      }
    },
